{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_226_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_226","textTraditional":"一、十有三年，春，齊侯次於垂葭。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_226_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_226","textTraditional":"二、夏，築蛇淵囿。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_226_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_226","textTraditional":"三、大蒐於比蒲。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_226_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_226","textTraditional":"四、衞公孟彄帥師伐曹。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_226_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_226","textTraditional":"五、秋，晉趙鞅入於晉陽以叛。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_226_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_226","textTraditional":"以者，不以者也。叛，直叛也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_226_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_226","textTraditional":"六、冬，晉荀寅、士吉射入於朝歌以叛。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_226_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_226","textTraditional":"七、晉趙鞅歸於晉。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_226_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_226","textTraditional":"此叛也，其以歸言之何也？貴其以地反也。貴其以地反，則是大利也。非大利也，許悔過也。許悔過，則何以言叛也？以地正國也。以地正國，則何以言叛？其入無君命也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_226_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_226","textTraditional":"八、薛弒其君比。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}